##  misc


# apple-app-site-association: served by dropin.lat (expect 200 + application/json)
curl -i https://dropin.lat/.well-known/apple-app-site-association

# Same file, as Apple's servers cache it (what iOS actually reads outside developer mode)
curl -s https://app-site-association.cdn-apple.com/a/v1/dropin.lat

# Team prefix of the simulator build: must be HT3SFSF7CQ, as in the AASA file
plutil -p ~/Library/Developer/Xcode/DerivedData/Dropin-*/Build/Intermediates.noindex/Dropin.build/Debug-iphonesimulator/Dropin.build/Dropin.app-Simulated.xcent

